WEBVTT

00:00:10.354 --> 00:00:11.814
I'm hungry.

00:00:24.134 --> 00:00:28.794
Hey, rodent! Rodent, where are you?

00:00:30.274 --> 00:00:34.104
Momotaro, even you have to wash
your hair once in a while.

00:00:34.104 --> 00:00:37.204
You haven't washed in ages! Hey, Momotaro!

00:00:38.544 --> 00:00:41.214
After I told him not to go out on his own...

00:00:41.214 --> 00:00:42.584
Typical rodent.

00:00:45.114 --> 00:00:46.554
Seeds!

00:00:46.554 --> 00:00:50.354
How I adore sunflower seeds!

00:00:51.254 --> 00:00:54.154
Kanari kiteru Muteki no Power!

00:00:54.564 --> 00:00:57.424
Maji de ii kanji

00:00:57.794 --> 00:01:00.564
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:01.004 --> 00:01:04.164
Ashita e saa ikou!

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:07.204
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:07.204 --> 00:01:08.374
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:08.374 --> 00:01:09.644
Zettai Karen Children
Zettai!

00:01:09.644 --> 00:01:11.314
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:11.314 --> 00:01:12.334
Zettai Karen Children
Daitan!

00:01:12.514 --> 00:01:15.814
Fureau dake de wakaru

00:01:15.814 --> 00:01:18.254
Kokoro no limiter

00:01:18.984 --> 00:01:21.684
Tokihanatareta hora

00:01:22.084 --> 00:01:25.284
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:25.524 --> 00:01:28.394
Atsui battle Nandomo try!

00:01:28.694 --> 00:01:31.994
Real wo tsuranuite

00:01:31.994 --> 00:01:35.234
Zettai karen! Dakara makenai!

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:38.174
Thrill ga SAIKOU!

00:01:39.304 --> 00:01:45.784
Yuuki ga sekai no yami wo terashi hajimeru

00:01:45.784 --> 00:01:51.714
Anata ga kureta kiseki afureru

00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:58.544
Darenimo nitenai egao hokori ni shitara

00:01:58.754 --> 00:02:03.294
Mirai wo ima koeyou

00:02:03.294 --> 00:02:07.394
We can try over the future world!

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:07.994
Yeah!

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:09.394
Saidai!

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:12.764
Daitan!

00:02:20.884 --> 00:02:21.714
PET SHOP SHIINA

00:02:21.714 --> 00:02:24.784
PET SHOP SHIINA
20th sense.
"Super Beast Cartoon!
Sometimes, You Act Like an Animal..."

00:02:24.784 --> 00:02:25.304
PET SHOP SHIINA

00:02:27.654 --> 00:02:30.184
These are the tastiest ones of all!

00:02:34.224 --> 00:02:36.934
What a babe! Just my type!

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.764
Held prisoner, huh? I'll let you out right now!

00:02:46.474 --> 00:02:48.004
What the hell?!

00:02:48.004 --> 00:02:52.964
Who cares how good she looks if
she's just some stupid rat brain?

00:03:22.614 --> 00:03:24.974
BABEL 1, ready for launch.

00:03:24.974 --> 00:03:26.884
Please proceed to hangar bay 2.

00:03:26.884 --> 00:03:29.884
Well sir, we're off to conduct
enhancement training for The Hound.

00:03:29.884 --> 00:03:32.314
Good. I leave it in your hands, Minamoto.

00:03:32.314 --> 00:03:36.154
Now, go to the wilderness and
polish your developing skills!

00:03:36.154 --> 00:03:37.884
Polish skills!

00:03:38.524 --> 00:03:40.824
Good luck, Akira. And you too, Hatsune.

00:03:40.824 --> 00:03:41.854
Right! I will!

00:03:47.104 --> 00:03:50.104
Ms. Kashiwagi, about the girls tonight...

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:52.604
Don't worry about The Children.

00:03:52.604 --> 00:03:54.704
Thanks again. I'm counting on you.

00:03:54.704 --> 00:03:55.674
See you later!

00:04:13.064 --> 00:04:17.364
Yahoo! Oboro's coming over tonight!

00:04:17.364 --> 00:04:19.404
I foresee plot developments from an adult comic!

00:04:19.404 --> 00:04:21.464
Kaoru's in a good mood.

00:04:21.464 --> 00:04:23.734
What is she expecting to happen?

00:04:29.414 --> 00:04:30.774
Isn't that Major Hyobu's...

00:04:30.774 --> 00:04:31.544
Momotaro!

00:04:31.674 --> 00:04:33.584
He looks really weak!

00:04:33.584 --> 00:04:35.414
Let's bring him home and take care of him!

00:04:36.154 --> 00:04:38.314
But he's Major Hyobu's flying squirrel!

00:04:38.314 --> 00:04:40.544
Oh, it'll be fine. Quit worrying!

00:04:47.064 --> 00:04:48.284
Metamorphosis!

00:04:51.194 --> 00:04:52.664
Good job, Hatsune!

00:04:52.664 --> 00:04:56.104
Your metamorphosis has gotten
smoother. How about you, Akira?

00:05:00.444 --> 00:05:02.034
And a perfect Replace!

00:05:02.914 --> 00:05:06.284
Mr. Minamoto, there's something in the woods!

00:05:06.284 --> 00:05:08.774
A building... I think it's abandoned.

00:05:17.754 --> 00:05:20.314
Maybe it was an army bomb
shelter from before the war.

00:05:23.034 --> 00:05:23.794
What's?

00:05:33.544 --> 00:05:35.504
Th- This is!

00:05:35.504 --> 00:05:36.734
Mr. Minamoto!

00:05:37.374 --> 00:05:38.864
What is it?

00:05:41.214 --> 00:05:42.804
2ND ANIMAL ENHANCEMENT PROJECT
Imperial Forces Special Esper Unit 3105

00:05:43.154 --> 00:05:47.024
I see. They were doing animal
enhancement experiments

00:05:47.024 --> 00:05:49.044
to give them psychic powers!

00:05:51.054 --> 00:05:53.024
One of the lids is open.

00:05:53.624 --> 00:05:55.114
Yeah...

00:06:06.044 --> 00:06:08.064
Will he drink that sugar water?

00:06:14.384 --> 00:06:16.214
He's drinking! He's drinking!

00:06:16.284 --> 00:06:18.054
Oh, be careful!

00:06:18.054 --> 00:06:21.384
If his blood pressure rises and
he wakes up fully, he might!

00:06:23.954 --> 00:06:25.654
The experiment was successful.

00:06:25.654 --> 00:06:28.024
Yeah, but he's still a mean little thing, huh?

00:06:28.024 --> 00:06:29.634
That's fine.

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:32.294
He can run as wild as he wants when
we dump him in enemy territory.

00:06:36.774 --> 00:06:38.034
Why?!

00:06:38.034 --> 00:06:39.444
Are you the enemy?

00:06:39.444 --> 00:06:41.244
What are you talking about, Momotaro?!

00:06:41.244 --> 00:06:43.204
Momotaro?! Who's that?!

00:06:44.214 --> 00:06:45.914
What are you doing to me?!

00:06:45.914 --> 00:06:46.844
Oh, no!

00:06:46.914 --> 00:06:50.504
He's lost his recent memories!
He doesn't remember us!

00:06:51.084 --> 00:06:53.154
You mean he has amnesia?!

00:06:53.154 --> 00:06:54.054
Why?!

00:06:54.054 --> 00:06:55.684
WHO ARE YOU?!

00:06:55.684 --> 00:06:58.594
No! Just bear the pain! He's confused!

00:06:58.594 --> 00:07:00.564
Make him see there's nothing to fear!

00:07:00.564 --> 00:07:01.824
Right!

00:07:10.274 --> 00:07:13.544
Doesn't hurt... No, actually, it really does!

00:07:13.544 --> 00:07:15.234
I mean, there's nothing to fear!

00:07:20.184 --> 00:07:21.644
It worked!

00:07:22.954 --> 00:07:26.144
You were really brave! You can let it out in here.

00:07:26.254 --> 00:07:30.054
That... HURT!

00:07:35.624 --> 00:07:37.434
So, you guys are all espers, huh?

00:07:37.434 --> 00:07:38.734
That hurt...
So, you guys are all espers, huh?

00:07:38.734 --> 00:07:40.404
Now what do we do?
I guess I like you, then.

00:07:40.404 --> 00:07:41.104
We need to return him to Major Hyobu,
don't you think?
I guess I like you, then.

00:07:41.104 --> 00:07:43.374
We need to return him to Major Hyobu,
don't you think?

00:07:43.374 --> 00:07:45.234
Hyobu? Who's that?

00:07:46.374 --> 00:07:48.864
I know! We can keep him here!

00:07:49.614 --> 00:07:52.074
He's lost his recent memories!

00:07:52.074 --> 00:07:55.684
I think he'd be happier living here
as a normal flying squirrel

00:07:55.684 --> 00:07:58.014
than if we took him back to Major Hyobu.

00:07:58.014 --> 00:08:00.354
Maybe, but he's not a normal flying squirrel.

00:08:01.424 --> 00:08:03.894
First of all, Mr. Minamoto would never allow it.

00:08:03.894 --> 00:08:06.124
We can't keep him here without
Mr. Minamoto finding out.

00:08:08.464 --> 00:08:10.724
Good evening! I'm here!

00:08:11.534 --> 00:08:12.564
It's Oboro!

00:08:12.564 --> 00:08:14.154
This is bad!

00:08:14.264 --> 00:08:15.664
She'll find him!

00:08:16.834 --> 00:08:18.964
Where is everyone?

00:08:19.544 --> 00:08:20.134
Oh?

00:08:21.374 --> 00:08:22.674
You're in the bath already?

00:08:22.674 --> 00:08:26.204
We figured we'd clean ourselves up,
since you were coming over.

00:08:26.684 --> 00:08:29.144
You're up to something again, aren't you?!

00:08:29.144 --> 00:08:31.084
I know what you girls are like!

00:08:31.084 --> 00:08:35.084
I'm making dinner! Finish up in there, soon!

00:08:35.084 --> 00:08:36.644
Okay!

00:08:50.234 --> 00:08:52.334
Look, I'm telling you, it's safe.

00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:54.464
Nothing to be scared of. Just come in with us!

00:08:54.744 --> 00:08:58.744
No! I decline! I decline, as hard as I can!

00:08:58.744 --> 00:09:02.444
We shouldn't force him, should we?
He doesn't smell that bad.

00:09:02.444 --> 00:09:04.154
I suppose...

00:09:04.154 --> 00:09:08.254
Ah! Oboro's here, and what are we doing?!

00:09:08.254 --> 00:09:09.224
You!

00:09:09.224 --> 00:09:11.414
Don't include us in this!

00:09:17.364 --> 00:09:19.294
Miss Oboro!

00:09:19.294 --> 00:09:22.234
Adult comics! Adult comics! Adult comics!

00:09:23.174 --> 00:09:26.074
Ah! You're getting me wet! Get off me!
Join me for some adult comics...
I mean, in the bath!

00:09:26.074 --> 00:09:30.564
Ah! You're getting me wet! Get off me!
C'mon, it'll be fine! Undress and get in the bath!

00:09:31.614 --> 00:09:33.234
Get away from Kaoru!

00:09:34.384 --> 00:09:35.714
Get away from her, human!

00:09:35.714 --> 00:09:36.954
Momotaro?

00:09:36.954 --> 00:09:38.214
Isn't that Major Hyobu's?

00:09:38.214 --> 00:09:39.014
Uh-oh!

00:09:47.694 --> 00:09:51.034
It's a shame that discovery
meant canceling your training.

00:09:51.034 --> 00:09:53.404
Would you like to have dinner
at my place to make up for it?

00:09:53.404 --> 00:09:55.164
Yes! It'd be a pleasure!
Yay! Food! Food!

00:09:56.004 --> 00:09:59.564
Oboro's probably made a ton of food.

00:10:02.044 --> 00:10:03.774
What's wrong, Hatsune?

00:10:03.774 --> 00:10:06.174
The same scent as before.

00:10:07.184 --> 00:10:11.054
"Before?" You mean, from the
research lab we found today?

00:10:11.054 --> 00:10:11.814
Yes.

00:10:11.814 --> 00:10:13.444
That can't be.

00:10:17.424 --> 00:10:19.514
Kaoru! Shiho! Aoi!

00:10:22.164 --> 00:10:24.234
Get away from Kaoru!

00:10:24.234 --> 00:10:25.294
Kaoru!

00:10:25.294 --> 00:10:26.424
Are you in on this, too?!

00:10:29.534 --> 00:10:30.864
Kaoru!

00:10:31.634 --> 00:10:34.194
Special espers, The Children!

00:10:37.474 --> 00:10:39.004
Released!

00:10:40.084 --> 00:10:41.474
<<RELEASED>>

00:10:46.924 --> 00:10:50.354
PSYCHIC BRUTE FORCE SUPPRESSION!

00:10:56.934 --> 00:10:59.134
Looks like we managed to catch him.

00:10:59.134 --> 00:11:02.264
Okay, what's the next move, Kaoru...

00:11:02.864 --> 00:11:06.274
Kaoru! Bath towel! Bath towel!

00:11:20.554 --> 00:11:22.684
This tastes great!

00:11:25.394 --> 00:11:27.694
Things are about to get a lot worse!

00:11:28.964 --> 00:11:30.634
Amnesia?

00:11:30.634 --> 00:11:34.104
Please, Minamoto, can't we just keep him here?

00:11:34.104 --> 00:11:38.364
We can't, because he's an experimental animal.

00:11:38.834 --> 00:11:39.994
Experimental animal?

00:11:40.374 --> 00:11:45.714
Yes. He's a survivor of a project to
create artificial espers for warfare.

00:11:46.544 --> 00:11:48.984
You mean he was forced to be an esper?

00:11:50.214 --> 00:11:52.484
It was wartime.

00:11:52.484 --> 00:11:55.944
Every nation on Earth was doing the same thing.

00:11:57.754 --> 00:12:01.664
He has the power to fire
blasts of air like missiles.

00:12:01.664 --> 00:12:03.464
I feel sorry for him, but he's too dangerous.

00:12:03.464 --> 00:12:07.064
Our only choice is to hold him at
BABEL for controlled study.

00:12:07.064 --> 00:12:09.464
Minamoto, you'll help him, won't you?

00:12:09.904 --> 00:12:12.074
Don't be unreasonable, Kaoru.

00:12:12.074 --> 00:12:14.904
It's the only choice. Don't make
things difficult for Minamoto.

00:12:22.344 --> 00:12:24.184
It's a thought attack!

00:12:24.184 --> 00:12:27.274
Keep calm! He can't keep up that
high a level for very long!

00:12:27.654 --> 00:12:31.294
How dare you trick me!
Kaoru! You are my enemy!

00:12:31.294 --> 00:12:33.224
No, Momotaro! I...

00:12:33.824 --> 00:12:35.694
You tricked me to capture me!

00:12:36.164 --> 00:12:37.424
Look out!

00:12:40.604 --> 00:12:42.864
Akira! How dare you do that to him!

00:12:43.434 --> 00:12:45.834
I hate you humans! I hate you! I hate you!

00:12:46.304 --> 00:12:47.644
Bring him down, now!
His ribs are broken!
He needs an ambulance, fast!

00:12:47.644 --> 00:12:48.674
Wait! Momotaro isn't bad!
His ribs are broken!
He needs an ambulance, fast!

00:12:48.674 --> 00:12:50.194
Wait! Momotaro isn't bad!

00:12:53.984 --> 00:12:57.254
I'll eat you for what you did to Akira!
I'll bring you down!

00:12:57.254 --> 00:12:59.014
Hatsune, wait! I'm coming, too!

00:12:59.014 --> 00:13:00.954
No, Kaoru! I'll go!

00:13:02.084 --> 00:13:04.824
You all stay here with Akira!

00:13:04.824 --> 00:13:06.354
Oboro could do that...

00:13:06.354 --> 00:13:08.324
Do what I say!

00:13:08.324 --> 00:13:11.824
Now that he's injured a human,
there's no other choice left!

00:13:12.364 --> 00:13:13.634
Give it up.

00:13:13.634 --> 00:13:16.224
You mean you're going to kill Momotaro?!

00:13:17.934 --> 00:13:21.844
Even though it was humans who made him
an esper so they could use him?!

00:13:21.844 --> 00:13:24.974
We can't leave a dangerous animal roaming free!

00:13:24.974 --> 00:13:28.414
You'd understand if this was
a lion or tiger, right?

00:13:28.414 --> 00:13:29.604
You're wrong!

00:13:31.414 --> 00:13:33.974
You're only saying that because you're a Normal!

00:13:34.224 --> 00:13:36.844
Because you're not a lion or a tiger!

00:13:41.624 --> 00:13:45.534
Those are magic rings to teach
you wild animals to behave.

00:13:45.964 --> 00:13:47.994
When you're good girls, I'll take them off.

00:13:48.564 --> 00:13:52.734
I don't care that you're espers!
You're all still just little girls!

00:13:53.444 --> 00:13:57.034
You're not wild animals. You're
mankind's precious future!

00:13:57.474 --> 00:13:59.914
And protecting that precious future

00:13:59.984 --> 00:14:02.414
is the duty we adults must bear!

00:14:07.254 --> 00:14:10.594
Protect Momotaro the way you
protected us that other time!

00:14:10.594 --> 00:14:14.564
Why won't you say it?! Tell us it'll
be all right and not to worry?

00:14:14.564 --> 00:14:16.084
To leave this to you!

00:14:17.794 --> 00:14:19.364
I'm sorry.

00:14:19.364 --> 00:14:21.504
Kashiwagi, alert BABEL to send
out the special forces unit!

00:14:21.504 --> 00:14:22.724
Minamoto!
Kashiwagi, alert BABEL to send
out the special forces unit!

00:14:23.474 --> 00:14:25.024
Nothing personal!

00:14:32.274 --> 00:14:34.874
Little rat! How dare you hurt Akira!

00:14:35.744 --> 00:14:37.414
Found you!

00:14:39.114 --> 00:14:40.344
Gotcha!

00:14:42.654 --> 00:14:44.654
B-Boss...

00:14:44.654 --> 00:14:47.894
I'm sorry about Akira, but stop this!

00:14:47.894 --> 00:14:49.664
But...

00:14:49.664 --> 00:14:50.754
Hands off!

00:14:52.764 --> 00:14:54.334
Okay.

00:14:54.334 --> 00:14:56.874
But what are you planning to do, Kaoru?

00:14:56.874 --> 00:14:59.704
You two, stay back! I'll handle this, somehow!

00:15:00.404 --> 00:15:02.934
You tricked me! Tricked me and betrayed me!

00:15:03.614 --> 00:15:07.204
No! I can almost understand how you feel!

00:15:07.444 --> 00:15:09.144
Shut up!

00:15:11.114 --> 00:15:12.184
Boss!
Kaoru!

00:15:12.184 --> 00:15:13.584
She's not trying to dodge!

00:15:13.984 --> 00:15:15.544
Shut up! Shut up!

00:15:16.224 --> 00:15:21.024
If that had happened to me, I might
be doing the same thing you are!

00:15:23.094 --> 00:15:23.924
Boss!
Kaoru!

00:15:28.134 --> 00:15:29.864
D-Dammit!

00:15:30.204 --> 00:15:33.404
They're staging a total mutiny!

00:15:33.574 --> 00:15:36.564
I'm sorry, if I'd just realized sooner...

00:15:36.844 --> 00:15:38.204
Mr. Minamoto.

00:15:38.974 --> 00:15:43.514
If he hadn't hurt me, could you
do something to help him?

00:15:43.514 --> 00:15:45.014
Akira!

00:15:45.014 --> 00:15:49.384
I tried to steal Momotaro's
body by replacing him,

00:15:49.384 --> 00:15:51.894
but his guard was too strong and I failed.

00:15:51.894 --> 00:15:55.294
But in that moment, his feelings
came through to me.

00:15:56.564 --> 00:16:00.664
He was originally raised by those researchers.

00:16:00.664 --> 00:16:05.204
And he hates them so much
for betraying his trust.

00:16:05.204 --> 00:16:10.764
But maybe that's just the flip side of him
still having some attachment to humans.

00:16:11.774 --> 00:16:15.874
If Kaoru succeeds, he might trust humans again.

00:16:16.284 --> 00:16:19.714
Hatsune's hurt me this bad
when she's been hungry!

00:16:19.714 --> 00:16:21.244
Ow!

00:16:23.254 --> 00:16:28.384
I understand. They consider
Momotaro to be one of them.

00:16:31.194 --> 00:16:32.184
Even so!

00:16:32.864 --> 00:16:35.134
Looks like you've had some fun here.

00:16:35.134 --> 00:16:36.624
Major Hyobu!

00:16:38.204 --> 00:16:41.934
ESP isn't magic. This will hurt a bit.

00:16:45.074 --> 00:16:47.134
Your broken bones should be knit together, now.

00:16:47.884 --> 00:16:50.414
I'll help you, as well.

00:16:50.414 --> 00:16:52.814
Here kid, use this.

00:16:53.824 --> 00:16:57.984
Better hurry. Take too long, and the Queen...

00:16:58.454 --> 00:17:02.954
Kaoru, I mean. You'll miss seeing
me do for her what you could not.

00:17:16.004 --> 00:17:17.344
Mr. Hyobu?

00:17:19.014 --> 00:17:21.814
You're incorrigible.

00:17:21.814 --> 00:17:23.644
Leave the rest to me.

00:17:24.384 --> 00:17:26.854
It's all right. You have nothing
to worry about anymore.

00:17:27.854 --> 00:17:32.684
You're our queen. I'd never do
anything to make you sad.

00:17:33.154 --> 00:17:34.954
But, I!

00:17:35.664 --> 00:17:36.684
Momotaro?

00:17:37.864 --> 00:17:40.134
Your hatred of humans and sadness are so deep

00:17:40.134 --> 00:17:41.694
you can't let them go, can you?

00:17:42.304 --> 00:17:45.494
You want to hit someone so badly, your
chest feels like it'll burst, doesn't it?

00:17:46.634 --> 00:17:48.104
What are you trying to do?

00:17:48.104 --> 00:17:50.874
Just stepping into the role you were just playing.

00:17:52.044 --> 00:17:54.414
Come on! I'll give you someone to fight!

00:17:57.014 --> 00:17:59.914
You won't forgive until you've
hit everything, will you?

00:18:00.854 --> 00:18:02.284
Mr. Hyobu!

00:18:03.794 --> 00:18:06.154
That's it! That's the way!

00:18:07.094 --> 00:18:10.554
I thought of myself as human once.

00:18:12.064 --> 00:18:15.124
And so, for everyone's sake, I fought.

00:18:15.564 --> 00:18:17.664
Because I believed in my
nation and my comrades.

00:18:19.074 --> 00:18:22.664
Which is why, I'll never forget
the day when I learned...

00:18:24.574 --> 00:18:25.604
how wrong I was.

00:18:26.474 --> 00:18:29.074
The same as you.

00:18:36.894 --> 00:18:38.484
Major...

00:18:39.154 --> 00:18:40.364
Are you all okay?

00:18:40.364 --> 00:18:41.454
Mr. Minamoto!

00:18:45.834 --> 00:18:47.664
Look well, kid!

00:18:47.664 --> 00:18:51.464
Only an esper can truly understand
another esper's heart!

00:18:55.874 --> 00:18:57.634
Mr. Hyobu!

00:18:59.474 --> 00:19:01.274
Aren't you carrying this a little far?

00:19:01.744 --> 00:19:03.234
Has he had enough?

00:19:03.814 --> 00:19:06.754
Would you give it a rest, you little pipsqueak?!

00:19:06.754 --> 00:19:09.484
Who do you think woke you
up in the first place?!

00:19:09.484 --> 00:19:11.254
If you don't stop!

00:19:12.294 --> 00:19:14.084
I'll tear you apart!

00:19:15.524 --> 00:19:19.494
How long are you going to bitch about
something that happened so long ago?!

00:19:19.494 --> 00:19:21.364
He's one to talk...

00:19:21.934 --> 00:19:23.434
Shut up, human!

00:19:23.434 --> 00:19:24.304
Back at you!

00:19:25.074 --> 00:19:26.804
What are they doing?

00:19:26.804 --> 00:19:28.774
He doesn't practice what he preaches.

00:19:29.104 --> 00:19:31.174
Leggo, you jerk!

00:19:31.174 --> 00:19:33.234
No! You let go, first!

00:19:34.344 --> 00:19:36.474
They're not serious anymore.

00:19:37.514 --> 00:19:41.044
It's like a litter of dogs or foxes
wrestling with each other now.

00:19:43.494 --> 00:19:45.184
Wait, did he do that intentionally?

00:19:46.724 --> 00:19:49.024
Huh? Kyosuke!

00:19:49.024 --> 00:19:52.654
Serves me right for helping you.
You finally remember me?

00:19:53.904 --> 00:19:55.094
Kyosuke!

00:19:57.334 --> 00:19:58.634
Magi...

00:19:58.634 --> 00:20:00.804
You need help, too.

00:20:00.804 --> 00:20:03.034
I'm tired. Take me home.

00:20:03.844 --> 00:20:04.934
Hold it!

00:20:05.944 --> 00:20:07.244
Mr. Minamoto?

00:20:07.244 --> 00:20:08.974
I can't let him go!

00:20:09.744 --> 00:20:11.514
Minamoto!

00:20:11.514 --> 00:20:14.984
Because Momotaro and I are threats to society.

00:20:14.984 --> 00:20:17.144
But for whom does that society exist?

00:20:19.324 --> 00:20:23.664
I don't care. Shoot me.
Show those girls the truth.

00:20:23.664 --> 00:20:26.824
Show them which group needs
to be driven from this world!

00:20:40.844 --> 00:20:41.844
Minamoto...

00:20:41.844 --> 00:20:44.044
You took care of me, Kaoru.

00:20:46.984 --> 00:20:48.614
Thank you, Kaoru.

00:20:49.584 --> 00:20:51.154
Momotaro!

00:20:51.154 --> 00:20:55.094
I'll betray that pedo anytime you want me to!

00:20:55.724 --> 00:20:58.194
You little rodent! Of all the ungrateful!

00:20:58.194 --> 00:21:00.064
Bye, Kaoru!

00:21:00.064 --> 00:21:02.534
Come back here, rodent!
See you later, Momotaro!

00:21:19.614 --> 00:21:21.054
Kaoru.

00:21:21.684 --> 00:21:24.354
What's wrong? Aren't you riding with us?

00:21:24.354 --> 00:21:26.224
I'll ride with Miss Oboro!

00:21:28.664 --> 00:21:30.534
It's okay, Mr. Minamoto.

00:21:30.534 --> 00:21:33.964
Yeah. She just want to cool her head a little.

00:21:33.964 --> 00:21:35.404
But, I...

00:21:35.404 --> 00:21:37.634
You didn't shoot in the end, did you?

00:21:39.234 --> 00:21:41.604
Thank you, Mr. Minamoto.

00:21:41.604 --> 00:21:43.374
Mr. Minamoto, thanks!

00:21:45.374 --> 00:21:46.844
Thanks, you two.

00:21:50.354 --> 00:21:53.184
No! Don't touch me there!

00:21:53.184 --> 00:21:53.824
Our bathroom's wrecked now!

00:21:53.824 --> 00:21:55.184
Don't take advantage of the situation!
Our bathroom's wrecked now!

00:21:55.184 --> 00:21:56.784
Don't take advantage of the situation!
Why don't we go to your place

00:21:56.784 --> 00:21:59.414
and let the adult comic plot naturally unfold?

00:21:59.754 --> 00:22:02.224
Is this why you wanted to ride with me?!

00:22:02.224 --> 00:22:03.784
EXACTLY!

00:22:10.734 --> 00:22:16.174
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:22:16.174 --> 00:22:16.474
Yeah

00:22:33.524 --> 00:22:36.794
Anata no mae jaa, hora

00:22:38.564 --> 00:22:44.054
ESP mo yaku ni tatanai no

00:22:44.404 --> 00:22:50.534
Pitagorasu de sae mo kaimei dekinai

00:22:50.914 --> 00:22:53.204
Koi wa chie no wa

00:22:55.414 --> 00:23:00.144
Naki sou na kao shite utsumuicha dame da yo

00:23:00.584 --> 00:23:05.424
Egao kara kiseki wa umareru da mon

00:23:06.124 --> 00:23:07.524
DA DA Daihon'mei

00:23:07.524 --> 00:23:07.824
Kyun kyun!

00:23:07.824 --> 00:23:08.824
Anata wo

00:23:08.824 --> 00:23:09.294
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.294 --> 00:23:13.024
Daitan futeki mono shitai

00:23:13.164 --> 00:23:17.134
Kanari tsubireru hodo maji na no zettai!

00:23:17.134 --> 00:23:18.574
DA DA Daihenshin

00:23:18.574 --> 00:23:18.874
Kyun kyun!

00:23:18.874 --> 00:23:19.834
Anata e

00:23:19.834 --> 00:23:20.504
Hai hai!

00:23:20.504 --> 00:23:25.304
Dainamaito na kuchidzuke wo ageru

00:23:25.444 --> 00:23:28.214
Suki na'tte hoshii no zettai!

00:23:28.214 --> 00:23:38.414
DATTE Daihon'mei

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:40.994
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.994 --> 00:23:42.964
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:43.094
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.094 --> 00:23:44.294
Is it my imagination?

00:23:44.294 --> 00:23:46.664
I feel like someone's been watching
me for the last few days.

00:23:46.664 --> 00:23:48.004
Like I'm being followed.

00:23:48.004 --> 00:23:49.934
Why would someone do that to Miss Kashiwagi?

00:23:49.934 --> 00:23:52.974
Oboro Kashiwagi's private life
is a complete mystery.

00:23:52.974 --> 00:23:54.404
And I will lift that veil!

00:23:54.404 --> 00:23:55.974
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:55.974 --> 00:23:59.514
Episode 21: "Jack of All Trades,
Master of None! What's He So Mad About?!"

00:23:59.514 --> 00:24:01.814
Mr. Kugutsu, I'll be counting on you.

00:24:01.814 --> 00:24:04.684
Yes, sir! Moga-chan and I will do our best!

00:24:04.684 --> 00:24:04.984
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.814
Jack of All Trades, Master of None!
What's He So Mad About!?
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.814 --> 00:24:09.944
Jack of All Trades, Master of None!
What's He So Mad About!?
